# PengyOS — the shared stack that shadow's PAM files include (login, passwd,
# chsh, chfn, chpasswd, newusers, groupmems: "include system-auth").
# Without this file every one of them failed: console logins on a TTY or the
# serial port answered "Permission denied" (26.10.3, when shadow was rebuilt
# with PAM and started installing those files). Plain Unix accounts, as in
# `other`; sessions get limits, the environment and a logind session, as SSH
# logins do (pam.d/sshd).
auth      required  pam_env.so
auth      required  pam_unix.so
account   required  pam_unix.so
password  required  pam_unix.so sha512 shadow
session   required  pam_limits.so
session   required  pam_unix.so
session   optional  pam_systemd.so
